# Bundled sample clips are committed on purpose: playback must survive an
# offline demo or a network that blocks the upstream open-film hosts.
!server/public/media/*.mp4
# Poster frames are committed too: cards must not fall back to blank tiles when
# a third-party image host is unreachable.
!server/public/media/posters/
!server/public/media/posters/*.jpg
